===  E5-c012 L01
  back OLD: 'The rate of change of a positive price index. Its simple form is P(t)/P(t-1) - 1, a fraction per period, and its log form is ln(P(t)/P(t-1)). Every inflation figure states which form it uses and the period it covers (Definition 2.2).'
  back NEW: 'The rate of change of a positive price index. Its simple form is P(t)/P(t-1) - 1, a fraction per period, and its log form is ln(P(t)/P(t-1)). Each inflation figure states its form and the period it covers (Definition 2.2).'
