===  E5-c033 L02
  back OLD: 'Not as a measured quantity. Definition 2.1 uses measured output and inputs and a chosen alpha, and changing alpha changes the residual. In Lab 1 the average residual is 0.016254 at alpha = 0.2 and 0.010665 at alpha = 0.4 for one SIMULATED economy. Theorem 2.3 identifies the residual with TFP growth only inside the model, where A is known.'
  back NEW: 'Not as a measured quantity. Definition 2.1 uses measured output and inputs and a chosen alpha, and the residual depends on that alpha (Proposition 2.4). Theorem 2.3 identifies the residual with TFP growth only inside the model, where A is known.'
  grade OLD: 'C'
  grade NEW: 'T'
  basis OLD: 'Proposition 2.4; Lab 1 (SIMULATED)'
  basis NEW: 'Definition 2.1; Proposition 2.4; Theorem 2.3'
