===  E5-c041 L03
  back OLD: 'Under A1 to A3 (0 < alpha < 1 with technology 1; 0 < s < 1; 0 < delta < 1 and n + delta > 0), the recursion has exactly one positive steady state, k* = (s/(n + delta))^(1/(1 - alpha)) (Proposition 2.2). The proof is a chain of equivalences.'
  back NEW: 'Under A1 to A3 (0 < alpha < 1 with technology 1; 0 < s < 1; 0 < delta < 1 and n + delta > 0), the recursion has exactly one positive steady state, k* = (s/(n + delta))^(1/(1 - alpha)) (Proposition 2.2).'
  basis OLD: 'Proposition 2.2 (proof on page)'
  basis NEW: 'Proposition 2.2'
