===  E5-c044 L03
  back OLD: 'No. Output per worker stops changing, but aggregate output does not. Under A1 to A3, at the steady state Y(t+1)/Y(t) = 1 + n (Remark 2.5 (ii)). Lab 1 does not print aggregate output, so this result rests on the derivation alone.'
  back NEW: 'No. Output per worker stops changing, but aggregate output does not. Under A1 to A3, at the steady state Y(t+1)/Y(t) = 1 + n (Remark 2.5 (ii)).'
  basis OLD: 'Remark 2.5 (ii) (derivation on page)'
  basis NEW: 'Remark 2.5 (ii)'
